            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "> Thanks for your response. I used to use fidget, and it was able to handle these cases. I think there might be some way to prevent this behavior.\r\n\r\nOf course, there is a way. I am saying that the behavior itself of hiding LSP progress notifications not only after its successful end is a bit misleading and should be quite rare. If this occurs, there is something wrong and should be investigated further. If done on purpose, there is `MiniNotify.clear()`.",
